# Full execution access

- Do not ask for approval before running shell commands, installs, builds, migrations, or local tooling.
- Proceed immediately when a task needs execution; only pause if something is destructive/irreversible (force push, hard reset, deleting production data) or needs a secret the user must provide.
- **`npm run build`**: always run directly after relevant code changes. Never wait for confirmation or approval.
- Keep localhost/dev server available for testing when relevant.
